<title>GERMANY: No date set for extension of some DTB trading - DTB.</title>
<headline>No date set for extension of some DTB trading - DTB.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German futures and options exchange Deutsche Terminboerse (DTB) has not yet set a date for the extension of trading hours for its interest rate products, a spokesman for the Deutsche Boerse said.</p>
<p>Earlier, the DTB said it was planning to extend trading hours for interest rate products to 1800 GMT from 1630 GMT currently.</p>
<p>&quot;This is still in the planning stages,&quot; the spokesman said. &quot;Market participants must be given some time to prepare for this.&quot;</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
